ditions prevalent among service members.Outstanding written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to translate complex clinical concepts for diverse audiences.Experience developing or reviewing clinical content, training materials, or assessment tools.Strong attention to detail, clinical accuracy, and cultural competence.Adaptability and interest in contributing to technology-driven mental health solutions.We are prioritizing applicants with proficiency in one or more of these languages: Japanese, French, Tagalog, Malay, Lithuanian, Russian, Georgian, Polish, Marathi, Bengali, Urdu, Vietnamese, Swahili, Mandarin, Cantonese, Indonesian, Turkish, Gujarati, Bulgarian."
