ed DFM expertise across at least 2-3 manufacturing processes relevant to the project scope.4+ years of applied experience for model editing tasks; 10+ years for complex model creation assignments.Proven ability to tackle assembly-level modeling, not just single-part tasks.Experience in reverse engineering workflows, such as scan-to-CAD or point cloud conversions, is highly valued.Familiarity with CAD automation or scripting (e.g., Python, iLogic, NX Open, VBA) considered a strong plus for automating and standardizing workflows."
