r artifacts.Expertise spanning two or more branches of the U.S. military is a plus; a diverse background across roles is highly valued.Proven proficiency in written and verbal communication, particularly in conveying technical or operational subject matter.Demonstrated ability to craft, grade, and review back office documents, PowerPoints, memos, and spreadsheets for military or federal purposes.US-based contributor with broad familiarity with federal documentation standards and compliance best practices.Comfortable collaborating remotely and sharing insights on nuanced, highly procedural reporting tasks."
