kits and platforms such as RDKit, KNIME, Schrödinger, OpenEye, or MOE.Proven track record in small-molecule drug discovery, SAR/QSAR evaluation, ADMET prediction, or virtual screening workflows.Comfort working with public chemical and bioactivity databases and integrating diverse datasets for scientific analysis.Demonstrated ability to clearly communicate complex chemical and biological concepts in written feedback and reports.Experience participating in multidisciplinary and/or remote projects; familiarity with AI-assisted coding tools is a plus."
