ecord of contributing to high-impact research projects.Bachelor’s degree or higher in Molecular Biology, Cell Biology, or a related field.Preferred Qualifications:Experience with the development or evaluation of rubrics, especially for AI and data annotation workflows.Familiarity with designing datasets or protocols for AI training and human review processes.Previous collaboration with interdisciplinary or remote teams on data-driven biology projects."
