{
  html: "<html><head></head><body><p><strong>Job Title:</strong> Accountants and Auditors</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Job Type:</strong> Contractor</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Location:</strong> Remote</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Job Summary:</strong> In this role, you'll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input. No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Responsibilities:</strong></p><ol><li>Examine, analyze, and interpret accounting records to prepare and audit financial statements.</li><li>Provide expert advice on financial reporting, compliance, and best accounting practices.</li><li>Evaluate statements prepared by others for accuracy and regulatory compliance.</li><li>Install, review, or advise on systems for recording costs and budgetary data.</li><li>Apply knowledge of economics, accounting principles, and taxation to support high-quality AI model training datasets.</li><li>Contribute real-world insights to improve how AI systems understand financial documentation and processes.</li><li>Document findings clearly through effective written and verbal communication.</li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong>Required Skills and Qualifications:</strong></p><ol><li>Bachelor’s degree or higher in Accounting, Finance, Economics, or a related field.</li><li>In-depth expertise in economics, accounting, law, government regulations, and taxation.</li><li>Substantial experience preparing and auditing financial statements.</li><li>Strong understanding of cost accounting and budgetary controls.</li><li>Proficient in both written and verbal communication for technical subject matter.</li><li>Detail-oriented with a commitment to data accuracy and regulatory compliance.</li><li>Holding or having held one or more of the following job titles: Certified Public Accountant (CPA), Cost Accountant, Financial Auditor, General Accountant, Internal Auditor, Revenue Tax Specialist.</li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong>Preferred Qualifications:</strong></p><ol><li>Advanced certification (e.g., CPA, CMA, CIA) or equivalent practical experience.</li><li>Experience advising on or implementing financial systems and controls.</li><li>Demonstrated ability to communicate complex accounting concepts to diverse audiences.</li></ol><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><em>This opportunity is part of an AI training initiative. Your expertise will directly influence the way AI understands and processes financial information for our customer's team.</em></p></body></html>",
